CONTROLBAR:TC_ConstructFiresCommand
"&Fires Command"
END

CONTROLBAR:TC_ToolTipBuildFiresCommand
"Builds long-range fire support units. Their weapons outrange their own vision, so pair them with scouts and radar."
END

CONTROLBAR:TC_ConstructTheaterMissileLauncher
"&Theater Missile Launcher"
END

CONTROLBAR:TC_ToolTipBuildTheaterMissileLauncher
"Fires one cruise missile at targets up to four times the range of a Tomahawk. Long reload."
END

CONTROLBAR:TC_ConstructHeavyHowitzer
"&Heavy Howitzer"
END

CONTROLBAR:TC_ToolTipBuildHeavyHowitzer
"Slow-firing long-range artillery. Accurate against structures and massed vehicles, needs spotting."
END

CONTROLBAR:TC_ConstructLongRangeScud
"&Long-Range SCUD"
END

CONTROLBAR:TC_ToolTipBuildLongRangeScud
"Fires a single heavy SCUD at very long range. The longest reload in the arsenal."
END
